Acai Puree
The acai puree is a value of many recipes in the Trees Naturals book, it is used 7 times within the entire recipe book. The values of translated clothing are the purple shirt, and the light purple hippy tank. Acai Puree has a value that can be manipulated, arranged, even changed differently through the other Trees Naturals Smoothie Ingredients, having a real emphasis that we are creative as a company, can offer the original box of ice cream,  or create a limited edition based on the season, texture of time, or aesthetic marker.
How to Harvest and Prepare Acai Puree for Trees Naturals
Go to Acai location on your bike.
Fill your muslin bag with Acai.
Bring your Acai back to the processing factory on your bike.
Wash the acai in vinegar with the water stream in one of 80 rooms ins the processing factory.
Unpeel acai reserve peel for paints or acai poweder for makeup.
Take reserved peels and dehydrate them.
Take the acai, and boil 20 acai in 2 quarts water. Cool and blend the whole acai boil, and strain. Place n the same pot, the strained mixture, and add 5cups sugar free sweetener. Boil for 30 minutes until thick and consistent. Then place in a vacuum sealer bag, and seal the bag, should make 4 bags per batch., labeled for reconstituting as acai, for the acai fruit.
Place acai in freezer to be distributed to Trees Naturals Smoothie locations.
Take the extra leafs and twigs and notify manager that you have peel to be used in one of two applications, paint or makeup, and pits for more plants.
